OL,3,GNEWSABT agrees rescue deal to buy
OL,4,Abroadband operator TalkTalk
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK's biggest broadband provider,
OL,7,FBT, has agreed to buy rival operator
OL,8,FTalkTalk to save the company from
OL,9,Fcollapse.
OL,11,FThe takeover would end of months of
OL,12,Fspeculation over the future of TalkTalk
OL,13,Fand mean services for its millions of
OL,14,Fcustomers will continue as normal.
OL,16,FBT boss Alison Kirkby said it provided
OL,17,F"a safety net" for TalkTalk customers.
OL,18,FThe administrator, Alvarez & Marsal,
OL,19,Fsaid it also provided certainty for
OL,20,FTalkTalk's 900 staff based in Salford,
OL,21,FGreater Manchester.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
